The '''Headless Zombie''' is a [[Mob]] that can spawn during the {{MobSprite|Headless Horseman}} fight.

== Spawning ==
'''Headless Zombies''' will occasionally spawn in batches when fighting the {{MobSprite|Headless Horseman}}. 

== Behavior ==
'''Headless Zombies''' will quickly run around and attack nearby players.

